{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19107330","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19107330","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"narration:0:1910733001:1":{"text":"The blinding light vanishes in an instant.","source_cn":"","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE08E03BC94258D8B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"The blinding light vanishes in an instant.","female":"The blinding light vanishes in an instant.","variant_male_record_index":"253603","variant_female_record_index":"253604","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:1:1910733002:1":{"text":"Elphira and Calix stand once again in the cold, dark water.","source_cn":"","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB0DB37FC554139D9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Elphira and Calix stand once again in the cold, dark water.","female":"Elphira and Calix stand once again in the cold, dark water.","variant_male_record_index":"253605","variant_female_record_index":"253606","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910733003:1":{"text":"What was that?! All those lights... they all melted together. And that giant thing that floated up at the end. No, not a thing, a person...!","source_cn":"刚才那是什么？！ 刚才那些光……全部融在一起了？最后浮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B6515E054CA978A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910733004:1":{"text":"Was that the future? Or the past? Everyone vanished! That can't be real!","source_cn":"那是未来吗？还是过去？不，不……！大家都消失了，那不是真的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8040E293C3CD30F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910733005:1":{"text":"声音……","source_cn":"声音……","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x798C050872D5EC62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910733006:1":{"text":"It won't stop... The hunger... won't end...","source_cn":"声音……不停，饥渴……不止……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9ADC94D7A2E4563","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910733007:1":{"text":"Mister Calix...? Are you okay? Your eyes are twitching...","source_cn":"卡律先生……？你怎么了，你的眼睛在颤动……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB91D73F91F10FAE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1910733008:1":{"text":"No! Get away from me!","source_cn":"……不对，不对，滚开！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1091C91D0B72FC39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910733009:1":{"text":"But you...","source_cn":"可是你——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFC4117593210C71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1910733010:1":{"text":"别靠近我！","source_cn":"别靠近我！","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x36579876C896E39E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1910733011:1":{"text":"The drumming... It's clearer than it's ever been. The rhythm... I can hear the rhythm...","source_cn":"鼓声……比以往任何时候都要清晰。韵律，我听见韵律……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4722DEFAE8A5A733","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1910733012:1":{"text":"It's your name, Elphira, daughter of the Shallowfolk...! It's telling me how frail your tentacles are... how warm your flesh would be down here in the deep!","source_cn":"那是你的名字，艾菲拉，浅海裔的女儿……！它在告诉我，你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5FE1AC920116DF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1910733013:1":{"text":"You shouldn't be alone... No one can be alone...","source_cn":"你，不能一个人，谁都不能……孤身一人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32B9EA258A89CBA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1910733014:1":{"text":"Just gently rip... and you can get what you want...!","source_cn":"只要……轻轻……一撕……就可以……满足……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF51FF7A81FAB53A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1910733015:1":{"text":"No, no... I can still...","source_cn":"……不，不。我还能——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76461B98E13EE3FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1910733016:1":{"text":"卡律摇晃着站直身体，凝望着那些狂舞的、不再受自己控制的触腕，指尖如寒芒般闪动。","source_cn":"卡律摇晃着站直身体，凝望着那些狂舞的、不再受自己控制的...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x1B8B9D0A2C687987","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"253618","variant_female_record_index":"253619","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1910733017:1":{"text":"No, Mister Calix! Wait!","source_cn":"不要，卡律先——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F49B838D2E04E9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:19:1910733018:1":{"text":"A sharp shriek, accompanied by the sound of a limb being pierced...","source_cn":"","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4D8341D2268E7694","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"A sharp shriek, accompanied by the sound of a limb being pierced...","female":"A sharp shriek, accompanied by the sound of a limb being pierced...","variant_male_record_index":"253621","variant_female_record_index":"253622","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1910733019:1":{"text":"A terrible wound gapes open to the sea. Deep blue blood, thick and briny, wells from the gash. It drifts outward like smoke and is carried off by the current.","source_cn":"可怖的创口暴露在海中，深蓝色的血液混着腥咸从伤口汩汩流...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x854A92C12DD2B065","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"A terrible wound gapes open to the sea. Deep blue blood, thick and briny, wells from the gash. It drifts outward like smoke and is carried off by the current.","female":"A terrible wound gapes open to the sea. Deep blue blood, thick and briny, wells from the gash. It drifts outward like smoke and is carried off by the current.","variant_male_record_index":"253623","variant_female_record_index":"253624","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1910733020:1":{"text":"Calix goes pale as bleached coral. The cold seawater carries away the sweat on his brow. Pain takes the place of madness, and at last his face slowly settles back to calm.","source_cn":"卡律面色苍白得如同褪色的珊瑚，冰冷的海水带走了他额上的...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC33A5E82A87BA194","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Calix goes pale as bleached coral. The cold seawater carries away the sweat on his brow. Pain takes the place of madness, and at last his face slowly settles back to calm.","female":"Calix goes pale as bleached coral. The cold seawater carries away the sweat on his brow. Pain takes the place of madness, and at last his face slowly settles back to calm.","variant_male_record_index":"253625","variant_female_record_index":"253626","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1910733021:1":{"text":"Mister Calix! What are you doing?!","source_cn":"卡律先生！你在干什么？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x054F8B5A2EB5DB89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1910733022:1":{"text":"Pain can keep one awake...","source_cn":"疼痛……能让人保持清醒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1297C0DD182B0277","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1910733023:1":{"text":"But your hand...","source_cn":"但你的手……你的手……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE731711F6C300AB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1910733024:1":{"text":"我可以用神经毒素帮你止痛！别再流血了，我不想看到你受伤！","source_cn":"我可以用神经毒素帮你止痛！别再流血了，我不想看到你受伤！","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x6D792578DD23B68E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1910733025:1":{"text":"No... it's fine. We, Deepfolk, have very strong regenerative powers.","source_cn":"不……用。深海裔的自愈能力……很强。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3392BF3441F71A7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1910733026:1":{"text":"Plus, I need the pain. Otherwise, the hunger and sound will...","source_cn":"我需要疼痛，不然那股冲动，那个声音——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA6E8958AE45D64C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:30:1910733027:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight2\">I'm right here...</style>","source_cn":"","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCF951AE96F98FAD2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"highlight2\">I'm right here...</style>","female":"<style=\"highlight2\">I'm right here...</style>","variant_male_record_index":"253633","variant_female_record_index":"253634","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1910733028:1":{"text":"……什么？","source_cn":"……什么？","status":"ambiguous_source_text","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:34:1910733029:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight2\">We shall become one.</style>","source_cn":"","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x61F54DC2C5DA2728","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"highlight2\">We shall become one.</style>","female":"<style=\"highlight2\">We shall become one.</style>","variant_male_record_index":"253635","variant_female_record_index":"253636","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1910733030:1":{"text":"W-who's there...?!","source_cn":"谁，是谁？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBDCDC4BAB8876439","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1910733031:1":{"text":"No one is saying anything. You need to stay calm.","source_cn":"没人在说话，保持冷静！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62E20AAEB9EA4D34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1910733032:1":{"text":"Elphira clenches her jaw, but the drumming, loud as thunder, echoes through her bones... It rages inside her skull.","source_cn":"艾菲拉咬紧牙关，然而那剧烈如雷鸣的鼓声仍在骨缝中回荡…...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x80F276884D423A87","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Elphira clenches her jaw, but the drumming, loud as thunder, echoes through her bones... It rages inside her skull.","female":"Elphira clenches her jaw, but the drumming, loud as thunder, echoes through her bones... It rages inside her skull.","variant_male_record_index":"253639","variant_female_record_index":"253640","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:40:1910733033:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight2\">WE MUST BECOME ONE!</style>","source_cn":"","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD64CAB58FE321D33","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"highlight2\">WE MUST BECOME ONE!</style>","female":"<style=\"highlight2\">WE MUST BECOME ONE!</style>","variant_male_record_index":"253641","variant_female_record_index":"253642","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1910733034:1":{"text":"It's talking to me!","source_cn":"它还在说话……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A93046582B50F08","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1910733035:1":{"text":"I-I can't hear my own voice!","source_cn":"我、我听不见自己的声音了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29D171BFA4829BE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1910733036:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1910733037:1":{"text":"Calix forces himself to breathe, dips his tentacle in his own blood, and laboriously writes on the moss-covered stone.","source_cn":"卡律尽力呼吸，用触腕沾上自己的血，在苔石上艰难地涂抹着...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3C73D57B147B8782","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Calix forces himself to breathe, dips his tentacle in his own blood, and laboriously writes on the moss-covered stone.","female":"Calix forces himself to breathe, dips his tentacle in his own blood, and laboriously writes on the moss-covered stone.","variant_male_record_index":"253645","variant_female_record_index":"253646","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1910733038:1":{"text":"\"Clench your fists, the sense of touch, the taste of blood, feel the pain, it's the feeling of being alive.\"","source_cn":"“握紧双手，触感；血的味道，嗅觉；疼痛，活着的实感。”","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69E80760677A0577","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1910733039:1":{"text":"\"Cast out the sound. Cast out the voice. Use everything else to feel the world.\"","source_cn":"“摒弃声音，用其余一切来感受世界。”","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA965E97F93AE56C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1910733040:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1910733041:1":{"text":"\"Breathe deep. Tell me who you are.\"","source_cn":"“深呼吸，告诉我你是谁。”","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x063902D001C9886B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1910733042:1":{"text":"Nothing could be heard but the drumming. Yet when one opens their mouth, sound could be produced. Even amid that deafening roar, one could still utter their own voice.","source_cn":"除了鼓声，什么也听不见。但是，还可以张口，喉咙仍旧可以...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1246AB2D65D273B6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Nothing could be heard but the drumming. Yet when one opens their mouth, sound could be produced. Even amid that deafening roar, one could still utter their own voice.","female":"Nothing could be heard but the drumming. Yet when one opens their mouth, sound could be produced. Even amid that deafening roar, one could still utter their own voice.","variant_male_record_index":"253650","variant_female_record_index":"253651","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1910733043:1":{"text":"Elphira! I am a daughter of the Shallowfolk!","source_cn":"艾菲拉……浅海裔的女儿！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33587B9C371B9AA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1910733044:1":{"text":"\"Who am I?\"","source_cn":"“我是谁。”","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD095C8166890A6F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1910733045:1":{"text":"Calix, a member of the Deepfolk. Someone who can't wait to return home.","source_cn":"卡律，深海裔的兄长，等待回家的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x660457FE75C1659C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1910733046:1":{"text":"\"Remember how you feel right now. Remember your name. Don't let that voice take you.\"","source_cn":"“记住现在的感受。记住你的名字，不要让那个声音夺走你。”","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BB8E5958F6B824B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1910733047:1":{"text":"I'll... try...","source_cn":"我会……努力……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10465486DC2E77DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1910733048:1":{"text":"\"Good, hold on. Tell me what your wish is right now.\"","source_cn":"“很好。坚持住。说出你现在的心愿。”","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x041AD15A4F675CEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1910733049:1":{"text":"I want to know who it was in that vision... I want to know what really happened.","source_cn":"我想知道，景象中是谁……我想知道，究竟发生了什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69D027B4DF71C1E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1910733050:1":{"text":"我想要……知道！","source_cn":"我想要……知道！","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x39472222529AEB53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:59:1910733051:1":{"text":"“去实现你的心愿，不必管我。”","source_cn":"“去实现你的心愿，不必管我。”","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x00460DED26D22517","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:60:1910733052:1":{"text":"但你的情况可能会再恶化！","source_cn":"但你的情况可能会再恶化！","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x1DC24674C26911F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:61:1910733053:1":{"text":"“那是你的心愿，记住你是谁。记住！我在这里等你。”","source_cn":"“那是你的心愿，记住你是谁。记住！我在这里等你。”","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x533AE31BAC96705E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_